<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 69.7948 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 69.7948 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 69.7948 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 69.8363 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 14		  Oct 11</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     69.7948		 69.8363</p>
<p> volume ($ million)	    1.025		   4.075</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 45.8000		 45.9600</p>
<p> volume (DM million)	   0.015		   0.020</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
